---
description: Rules for F# code that C# calls in morphir-dotnet
globs: "**/*.fs,**/*.fsi,**/*.fsproj"
alwaysApply: false
---

When you add or change a public F# type, member or module, or the settings of an F# project, check whether a C# project uses it. If it does, follow the `fsharp-csharp-interop` skill in `.agents/skills/fsharp-csharp-interop/SKILL.md`, and run the `fsharp-csharp-interop-reviewer` subagent on the diff afterwards.
